  "title": "Ground Turkey Casserole",
  "description": "Its quick, fun and great! I learned this in grammar school. You may want to serve with corn bread or French bread and a salad.",
  "authors": [
    "Beki"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-02-29T00:27:16-05:00",
